{"b":"Ps","c":63,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"O God, thou art my God; early will I seek thee: my soul thirsteth for thee, my flesh longeth for thee in a dry and thirsty land, where no water is;","it":[[12,15]],"tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["Ps.143.6",42,"e"],["Ps.84.2",29,"e"],["Matt.6.33",26,"w"],["Ps.42.1",26,"w"],["Ps.42.2",26,"w"],["Ps.91.2",21,"r"],["Rev.7.16",19,"r"],["Rev.7.17",19,"r"],["Exod.15.2",17,"r"],["Ps.5.3",16,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"To see thy power and thy glory, so as I have seen thee in the sanctuary.","it":[[35,37]],"x":[["Ps.27.4",9,"r"],["Ps.105.4",7,"r"],["Ps.84.2",7,"r"],["Ps.84.11",7,"w"],["Ps.96.6",4,"w"],["1Chr.16.11",4,"r"],["1Sam.4.21",3,"w"],["1Sam.4.22",3,"w"],["Ps.145.11",3,"w"],["2Cor.4.4",3,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Because thy lovingkindness is better than life, my lips shall praise thee.","it":[[27,29]],"x":[["Ps.69.16",19,"w"],["Ps.51.15",18,"w"],["Phil.1.23",17,"w"],["Heb.13.15",13,"w"],["Ps.30.5",13,"r"],["Rom.12.1",9,"r"],["1Cor.6.20",9,"r"],["Rom.6.19",6,"r"],["Jas.3.5",6,"r"],["Jas.3.10",6,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Thus will I bless thee while I live: I will lift up my hands in thy name.","x":[["Ps.104.33",13,"w"],["Ps.134.2",9,"w"],["Ps.28.2",7,"w"],["Ps.145.1",5,"w"],["Ps.145.3",5,"r"],["1Kgs.8.22",5,"r"],["1Kgs.8.66",5,"r"],["Hab.3.10",3,"r"],["Ps.146.1",3,"r"],["Ps.146.2",3,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"My soul shall be satisfied as with marrow and fatness; and my mouth shall praise thee with joyful lips:","it":[[30,34],[81,85]],"x":[["Ps.36.7",9,"r"],["Ps.36.9",9,"r"],["Isa.25.6",7,"w"],["Ezra.3.11",5,"r"],["Ezra.3.13",5,"r"],["Ps.43.4",5,"w"],["Ps.17.15",5,"w"],["Ps.118.14",4,"r"],["Ps.118.15",4,"r"],["Rev.19.5",4,"w"]]},{"n":6,"t":"When I remember thee upon my bed, and meditate on thee in the night watches.","it":[[34,37],[62,67]],"x":[["Ps.42.8",16,"w"],["Ps.119.147",14,"r"],["Ps.119.148",14,"w"],["Ps.149.5",14,"r"],["Ps.119.55",13,"w"],["Ps.139.17",10,"r"],["Ps.139.18",10,"r"],["Ps.77.4",10,"r"],["Ps.77.6",10,"w"],["Lam.2.19",9,"w"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Because thou hast been my help, therefore in the shadow of thy wings will I rejoice.","x":[["2Cor.1.10",12,"r"],["Ps.27.9",10,"w"],["Ps.61.4",10,"w"],["Ps.54.3",8,"r"],["Ps.54.4",8,"r"],["Ps.57.1",8,"w"],["Ps.5.11",7,"w"],["1Sam.17.37",7,"r"],["Ps.17.8",7,"w"],["Ps.21.1",6,"w"]]},{"n":8,"t":"My soul followeth hard after thee: thy right hand upholdeth me.","x":[["Isa.41.10",11,"w"],["Ps.18.35",11,"w"],["Ps.73.23",9,"w"],["Ps.37.24",7,"w"],["Song.2.6",7,"w"],["Isa.42.1",6,"r"],["Ps.94.18",6,"r"],["Ps.73.25",6,"r"],["Ps.41.12",4,"r"],["Gen.32.26",3,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"But those that seek my soul, to destroy it, shall go into the lower parts of the earth.","it":[[10,14],[40,43]],"x":[["Ps.55.15",7,"r"],["Ps.40.14",6,"e"],["Ps.9.17",6,"r"],["Num.16.30",4,"r"],["Num.16.33",4,"r"],["1Sam.25.29",4,"w"],["Ps.86.13",4,"r"],["Isa.14.9",3,"r"],["Ezek.32.18",3,"w"],["Ezek.32.32",3,"r"]]},{"n":10,"t":"They shall fall by the sword: they shall be a portion for foxes.","x":[["Ezek.35.5",4,"w"],["Jer.18.21",4,"w"],["Rev.19.17",2,"r"],["Rev.19.18",2,"r"],["1Sam.26.10",2,"r"],["Ezek.39.17",2,"r"],["Ezek.39.20",2,"r"],["Ezek.39.4",2,"w"],["Song.2.15",2,"w"],["1Sam.31.1",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"But the king shall rejoice in God; every one that sweareth by him shall glory: but the mouth of them that speak lies shall be stopped.","x":[["Deut.6.13",11,"r"],["Ps.21.1",7,"w"],["Isa.65.16",6,"w"],["Isa.45.23",6,"w"],["Rom.3.19",5,"w"],["Heb.6.13",4,"r"],["1Sam.23.17",3,"r"],["1Sam.24.20",3,"r"],["Titus.1.10",3,"r"],["Titus.1.11",3,"w"]]}],"title":"A Psalm of David, when he was in the wilderness of Judah."}